# MyPyStub Release Notes

## 0.0.2 (7 Aug 2026)

* Start to implement development tooling
* Catch more exceptions from running scripts for display
* Do not install development versions of PyPI packages
* Workaround for Liquid Glass issues on iPad
* Basic Backup implementation (no restore yet)
* Provide an (out-of-date) template for building a complex script (simple scripts are fine)
* Add documentation
* Add AI icon/splash
* Improve PIP simulation

## 0.0.1 (21 Jun 2026)

* Initial release
